is  passive into his next barrage making him  a deadly ranged burst dps  one with the farts  [Music]  carle is a dendro support character who  wields a bone arrow as well as her main  weapon her skill is a large boomerang  that is tossed out and deals dendro  damage on cast and on return and summons  a ring of dendro around the character  and her burst creates a large dendro  explosion in a small area  now let's talk about the new element to  get an impact dendro this element brings  a lot to the table and has opened a lot  of doors for older characters who are  previously not considered meta so this  update will shake things up for invested  players  so how does dendro interact with other  elements first dendro does not react  with geo or animo  which is bad for geo but this can be  beneficial for animo actually  specifically for bursts that absorb  other elements which can create large  areas of fast supplying elements that  react to dendro separately and create  some extremely strong teams second it  doesn't react with cryo although it can  co-exist at the same time with cryo  which sometimes can keep dendro applied  on the enemy for a longer time which is  useful in certain teams  pyro and dendro is an old reaction  that's fairly straightforward it creates  burning which does damage over time  hydro and electro though are where  things get interesting and i'll show  examples of some teams that incorporate  each type of reaction applying hydro and  dendro causes bloom once you've dropped  a bloom seed it can react again with two  more elements electro and pyro electro  causes hyper bloom and sends damaging  homing attacks at your enemy  and hitting a seed with pyro instead  causes burgeon an explosion that does  immediate damage in a small area  [Music]  now for electro applying it to an enemy  with dendro causes quicken seen with  this green lightning a state that has  the ability to boost damage further for  either element hitting quickened enemies  with a follow-up electro attack causes  aggravate which is bonus damage for  electro attacks  and hitting quicken enemies with dendro  attacks causes spread which is bonus  damage for dendro attacks  [Music]  these reactions can give new life to  older characters such as lisa and toma  giving them a chance to be used as  specialized dendro teams which is an  awesome way to buff characters and shake  up the meta without directly changing  the characters themselves  small other updates are making their way  as well such as elemental resonances  like dendro boosting elemental mastery  by a flat amount and double hydro  switched from healing bonus to hp  instead they are also adding multiple  older artifact domains to the strongbox  for you to turn in your fodder into  better sets the lands of sumeru itself  consist of multiple beautiful biomes  cities and villages as secrets to  uncover with a blight taking over  portions of the map that only vision  holders can traverse through it's your  job to clear these areas and help the  people of sumeru subaru also has more  underground exploration as well with the  maze of tunnels you can discover new  enemies new quests new materials to  gather all orchestrated by a beautiful  soundtrack will keep you enthralled in  the land of sumeru  let us know what you're most excited  about in the massive sumaru update and  for all things gaming keep it here on  gamespot  [Music]  you
 

